      <p>无论您是移动、电信还是联通用户，无论您是追求 4K/8K 极致秒开的影音发烧友，还是需要大量纯净原生 IP 来支持跨境出海业务的工作室，极速cloud 目前展现出的网络素质都完全有资格成为您的主力或核心备用选项。别忘了在下单时使用专属优惠码 <code>ikds88</code>，将性价比进行到底！</p>
      
      <div class="declaration-box" style="background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65;"><strong>免责声明与测速说明：</strong> 本文使用的极速cloud测速图表来源于第三方 Impart 测速节点拓扑与速度测试数据。测速环境分别为北京联通 2Gbps、上海移动 2Gbps 及北京电信 1Gbps。需要注意的是，跑分图仅代表该次特定时间、特定网络环境下的极致表现，受限于用户本地光猫性能、路由器的 Wi-Fi 损耗以及高峰时段的具体波动，您的实际日常体验速度可能无法时刻保持在数 Gbps 的峰值，但满足流畅观影与极速网页加载绰绰有余。</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    
    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <div class="toc-container">
        <h3 class="toc-title">本文目录</h3>
        <ul id="toc-list" class="toc-list">
          <!-- JS will populate this -->
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>

  <style>
    .knowledge-layout {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      padding-top: 140px;
      padding-bottom: 80px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .article-content {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 56px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    
    .prose h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 32px; font-weight: 800; }
    .prose .lead-paragraph { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #374151; background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 36px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; line-height: 1.8; }
    .prose h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--blue); margin-top: 64px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 2px solid #eff4ff; padding-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
    .prose h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; color: #1f2937; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
    .prose p { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .prose a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    .prose a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .prose ul, .prose ol { margin-bottom: 28px; padding-left: 28px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #475569; }
    .prose ul li, .prose ol li { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .prose code { background: #f1f5f9; color: #ef4444; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.9em; font-family: monospace; display: inline-block;}
    
    .toc-sidebar { width: 300px; flex-shrink: 0; position: sticky; top: 120px; }
    .toc-container { background: #fff; padding: 28px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .toc-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .toc-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .toc-link { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: all 0.2s; display: block; line-height: 1.5; border-left: 2px solid transparent; padding-left: 12px; margin-left: 2px; }
    .toc-link:hover, .toc-link.active { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; border-left-color: var(--blue); }

    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .knowledge-layout { flex-direction: column; padding-top: 100px; }
      .toc-sidebar { display: none; }
      .article-content { padding: 32px 24px; border-radius: 12px; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const content = document.querySelector('.article-content');
      const tocList = document.getElementById('toc-list');
      if (!content || !tocList) return;

      const headings = content.querySelectorAll('h2, h3');
      
      headings.forEach((heading) => {
        if(!heading.id) return;
        const li = document.createElement('li');
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = '#' + heading.id;
        a.textContent = heading.textContent;
        a.className = 'toc-link';
        if(heading.tagName.toLowerCase() === 'h3') {
           a.style.paddingLeft = '24px';
           a.style.fontSize = '0.9rem';
        }
        li.appendChild(a);
        tocList.appendChild(li);
      });

      const observerOptions = { root: null, rootMargin: '-100px 0px -60% 0px', threshold: 0 };
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach(entry => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
            document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link').forEach(link => {
              link.classList.remove('active');
              if (link.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id) {
                link.classList.add('active');
              }
            });
          }
        });
      }, observerOptions);

      headings.forEach(heading => observer.observe(heading));
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
